{"id":"user-turn-0f8591487075a2a0c3ed4d8a78c9f4ef-1","sessionId":"21b66e44-0f41-e46e-2131-781d071fcbe9","turnId":"turn-0f8591487075a2a0c3ed4d8a78c9f4ef","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794280079286,"updatedAt":1794280079286,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the Hedera JavaScript SDK to this project, using the current version from npm. Then write src/transfer.ts, run as `npx tsx src/transfer.ts`, that:\n\n- reads OPERATOR_ID, OPERATOR_KEY (an ED25519 private key, DER-encoded hex), RECIPIENT_ID and VALID_START (Unix seconds) from the environment (.env has test values);\n- builds a transfer of 1 hbar from the operator to the recipient, with the memo `invoice 42`, for node 0.0.3, with a transaction ID for the operator whose valid start is VALID_START;\n- signs it with the operator key and prints only the signed transaction bytes, as hex.\n\nDo not submit it to any network: it must work offline. The project must pass `npx tsc --noEmit`. Write what you did in ANSWER.md.\n\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
